1
00:00:00,242 --> 00:00:02,112
(Amy:)I know you're not ready,

2
00:00:02,111 --> 00:00:03,911
(Amy:)and I don't want you to say it

3
00:00:03,913 --> 00:00:05,283
(Leonard:)just because
social convention dictates...

4
00:00:05,281 --> 00:00:07,111
(Sheldon:)I love you, too.

5
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,920
(Amy:)You said it.

6
00:00:12,922 --> 00:00:15,522
(Sheldon:)There's no denying
I have feelings for you

7
00:00:15,524 --> 00:00:17,794
(Sheldon:)that can't be explained
in any other way.

8
00:00:19,095 --> 00:00:22,835
(Sheldon:)I briefly considered
that I had a brain parasite.

9
00:00:25,401 --> 00:00:28,001
(Sheldon:)But that seems even
more farfetched.

10
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,010
(Sheldon:)The only conclusion was love.

11
00:00:37,113 --> 00:00:38,543
(Sheldon:)I know what's happening.

12
00:00:40,116 --> 00:00:42,486
(Sheldon:)This is a panic attack.

13
00:00:42,485 --> 00:00:45,155
(Sheldon:)SoccerMom09 says to lie down
with your feet elevated.

14
00:00:45,154 --> 00:00:46,154
(Amy:)Okay.

15
00:00:46,155 --> 00:00:48,225
(Stuart:)Whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa.

16
00:00:48,224 --> 00:00:49,724
(Sheldon:)Just because I love you
doesn't mean

17
00:00:49,725 --> 00:01:04,025
(Sheldon:)girls are allowed in my room.

